Detour's own trigonometry hooks in DetourCrowd and DetourTileCache

DetourMath.h declares dtMathCosf and dtMathSinf so that a build can replace
the C library's trigonometry, but DetourObstacleAvoidance.cpp (dtRorate2D and
sampleVelocityAdaptive) and DetourTileCache.cpp (addBoxObstacle's oriented
box) call cosf and sinf directly, past the hook. With the hook replaced by a
deterministic implementation (patches/0002) a crowd with
DT_CROWD_OBSTACLE_AVOIDANCE still took its sampling pattern from the platform's
libm, whose cosf and sinf differ by an ulp between glibc, macOS, the Windows
UCRT and emscripten: the same crowd walked to different places. The calls go
through the hooks; with the default DetourMath.h nothing changes. Not yet
upstream (recastnavigation main still calls cosf/sinf there).

Apply from upstream/recastnavigation: git apply -p1 ../../patches/0001-trig-through-detour-math-hooks.patch

diff --git a/DetourCrowd/Source/DetourObstacleAvoidance.cpp b/DetourCrowd/Source/DetourObstacleAvoidance.cpp
index 94f7df6..56bed74 100644
--- a/DetourCrowd/Source/DetourObstacleAvoidance.cpp
+++ b/DetourCrowd/Source/DetourObstacleAvoidance.cpp
@@ -496,8 +496,8 @@ inline void dtNormalize2D(float* v)
 // vector normalization that ignores the y-component.
 inline void dtRorate2D(float* dest, const float* v, float ang)
 {
-	float c = cosf(ang);
-	float s = sinf(ang);
+	float c = dtMathCosf(ang);
+	float s = dtMathSinf(ang);
 	dest[0] = v[0]*c - v[2]*s;
 	dest[2] = v[0]*s + v[2]*c;
 	dest[1] = v[1];
@@ -532,8 +532,8 @@ int dtObstacleAvoidanceQuery::sampleVelocityAdaptive(const float* pos, const flo
 	const int nd = dtClamp(ndivs, 1, DT_MAX_PATTERN_DIVS);
 	const int nr = dtClamp(nrings, 1, DT_MAX_PATTERN_RINGS);
 	const float da = (1.0f/nd) * DT_PI*2;
-	const float ca = cosf(da);
-	const float sa = sinf(da);
+	const float ca = dtMathCosf(da);
+	const float sa = dtMathSinf(da);
 
 	// desired direction
 	float ddir[6];
diff --git a/DetourTileCache/Source/DetourTileCache.cpp b/DetourTileCache/Source/DetourTileCache.cpp
index 6f97ab5..08c4ed2 100644
--- a/DetourTileCache/Source/DetourTileCache.cpp
+++ b/DetourTileCache/Source/DetourTileCache.cpp
@@ -448,8 +448,8 @@ dtStatus dtTileCache::addBoxObstacle(const float* center, const float* halfExten
 	dtVcopy(ob->orientedBox.center, center);
 	dtVcopy(ob->orientedBox.halfExtents, halfExtents);
 
-	float coshalf= cosf(0.5f*yRadians);
-	float sinhalf = sinf(-0.5f*yRadians);
+	float coshalf= dtMathCosf(0.5f*yRadians);
+	float sinhalf = dtMathSinf(-0.5f*yRadians);
 	ob->orientedBox.rotAux[0] = coshalf*sinhalf;
 	ob->orientedBox.rotAux[1] = coshalf*coshalf - 0.5f;
 
